u is still alive  to help deal with this demon king tundra  threat admittedly he's not in fighting  shape but he's up and even goes to hug  tanjuro trying to get him to remember  who he is and to not attack nezuko he's  sent flying back by one of tundra's  attacks however he's still not done and  continues to scream for nezuko and he  continues to beg tundra to stop this  madness thanks to kano who delivers the  medicine they succeed in turning tundra  back into a human and after the demon  fighting is finally over zanitsu is okay  promising nezuko that he'll make tundra  pay his whole life for what he did to  him and to his wife nezuko it's  impressive to see that zenitsu can walk  after some rest and even has enough  energy to get jealous when sun emi pats  nezuko on the head unlike tundra who  loses the use of one eye and arm zenitsu  could potentially from what we've seen  go on to be stronger than ever he hasn't  been nerfed at all from what we can tell  and if there was a need he would  definitely go on to become a hashida and  not just any hashira but the thunder god  hashida i say this because the word god  has only been associated so much with  zenith's thunder attacks and with no  other thunder breather and you can argue  that he surpassed the rest too by  creating the strongest thunder breathing  form yet that takes the form of a dragon  and is fast enough that even a  demon-enhanced talented thunder breather  can't see it let alone react in time to  avoid it now it should be said in the  extended ending while tundra was forcing  them to visit all the graves of the  fallen for three days zainsu started  crying about his painful legs and nezuko  carried him on her shoulders but i  believe this would have eventually  passed just as it did after he uses  godspeed against daki so yeah zaitsu is  arguably the strongest of our trio after  tundra got nerfed but more importantly  for him he gets to fulfill his dream of  marrying nezuko which i'm sure means way  m